<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Banco BBA 1996 net 149.7 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Banco BBA 1996 net 149.7 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian bank Banco BBA Creditanstalt said it posted a net profit of 149.7 million reais in 1996.</p>
<p>Banco BBA closed last year with 4.8 billion reais in total assets and a 428.9 million reais net worth, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Austria's Creditanstalt-Bankverein owns 49 percent of Brazil's Banco BBA Creditanstalt.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
